# Mini App UX

- Customer UI is Russian. Keep the compact workspace: thread + composer 20–25%, options in the popup — see `docs/14-Telegram-Customer-UX.md`.
- Do not turn the Mini App into a marketing landing or a second owner console.
- Motion stays purposeful (existing gold/cyan voice). No generic AI-orb chrome.
- **Experience Layer (DEC-011):** Rive runtime (`@rive-app/canvas`, CDN, progressive) + client event bus for the interview mascot is allowed. Events: `idle`, `listening`/`thinking`, `got_answer`, `got_voice`, `got_file`, `draft_ready`, `error`. Honor `prefers-reduced-motion` and «Спокойный режим» (`localStorage`). Do not change Discovery/API contracts, secrets, or HITL. No lip-sync/TTS puppet in this slice.
- Visual rules: `.cursor/skills/anti-slop-design/SKILL.md`.
